  "termsConditionsTitle": "Terms & Conditions",
  "termsConditionsIntro": "These Terms & Conditions govern your use of Jma3a, a social multiplayer game app. By creating an account or using the app, you agree to these Terms.",
  "termsSectionAccount": "Accounts",
  "termsSectionAccountBody": "You must be at least 13 years old to create a Jma3a account. You can sign up using a phone number or email address, which is verified with a one-time code. You are responsible for keeping your account credentials secure and for all activity on your account.",
  "termsSectionAcceptableUse": "Acceptable Use",
  "termsSectionAcceptableUseBody": "You agree to use Jma3a respectfully and not to harass, threaten, or abuse other users, impersonate others, or use the app for any unlawful purpose. Violations may result in content removal, feature restrictions, or account suspension.",
  "termsSectionContent": "Your Content",
  "termsSectionContentBody": "You retain ownership of the content you create, such as your profile and any packs or cards you make. By posting content in Jma3a, you grant us the right to display and distribute it within the app so other users can see and interact with it. You are responsible for the content you create or share.",
  "termsSectionCreators": "Creators & Official Accounts",
  "termsSectionCreatorsBody": "Jma3a offers Verified Creator status to eligible content creators, shown on their profile. Verified status may be granted or removed based on your account's standing and compliance with these Terms. An official Jma3a account may also appear in the app to share announcements and responses.",
  "termsSectionRoomsGames": "Rooms & Games",
  "termsSectionRoomsGamesBody": "Jma3a lets you create or join rooms to play multiplayer games with friends and other players, using packs of content provided by Jma3a or created by users. Room hosts and members are expected to follow these Terms while playing.",
  "termsSectionPremium": "Premium & Premium Plus",
  "termsSectionPremiumBody": "Jma3a offers optional Premium and Premium Plus subscriptions that unlock additional features and benefits within the app. What each tier includes may change over time; you will be shown what a subscription includes before you purchase it.",
  "termsSectionWallet": "Wallet & Payments",
  "termsSectionWalletBody": "Jma3a includes an in-app wallet that can be topped up using supported local payment methods. Creators may earn wallet balance from their content and request withdrawals, subject to Jma3a's review. Payments are also subject to the terms of the payment method provider you use.",
  "termsSectionModeration": "Reporting & Moderation",
  "termsSectionModerationBody": "You can report or block other users and content that violates these Terms. Jma3a may review reports and take action, including removing content, restricting features, or suspending or terminating accounts that violate these Terms.",
  "termsSectionTermination": "Suspension & Termination",
  "termsSectionTerminationBody": "We may suspend or terminate your account if you violate these Terms, misuse the app, or engage in fraudulent or harmful behavior. You may also request deletion of your account and data at any time.",
  "termsSectionAvailability": "Service Availability",
  "termsSectionAvailabilityBody": "Jma3a is provided on an \"as available\" basis. We may modify, suspend, or discontinue parts of the app at any time, and we do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free service.",
  "termsSectionChanges": "Changes to These Terms",
  "termsSectionChangesBody": "We may update these Terms from time to time. Continuing to use Jma3a after changes are published means you accept the updated Terms.",
